{"id":110786648635137,"type":"artist","name":"Thee Oh Sees","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":11,"info":{"bio":"Thee Oh Sees es un grupo de San Francisco, California; EEUU. El grupo empezó como una alternativa para John Dwyer para grabar sus grabaciones más experimentales. A lo largo de varios albumes y cambios de género, Thee Oh Sees se convirtió en un grupo estable con la siguiente formación: John Dwyer (voces, guitarra), Brigid Dawson (voces, teclados), Petey Dammit! (bajo, guitarra), Mike Shoun (batería), y Lars Finberg (batería, guitarra). El grupo es conocido por su prolífica discografía, sus enérgicos conciertos en directo y enigmáticaestética.\n\nEl grupo ha cambiado su nombre varias veces, siendo conocidos previamente como Orinoka Crash Suite, OCS, Orange County Sound, Thee Oh Sees y actualmente Oh Sees. . User-contributed text is available under the Creative Commons By-SA License; additional terms may apply.","tags":["Garage Rock","Lo-Fi","psychedelic","garage","Psychedelic Rock"],"aliases":"OCS","member_of":"Garage Rock,Lo-Fi,psychedelic,garage,Psychedelic Rock","similar":["Osees","Damaged Bug","Ty Segall","Frankie and the Witch Fingers","Fuzz","The Murlocs","Coachwhips","King Gizzard & The Lizard Wizard","Ty Segall Band","Meatbodies"],"links":{"spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/3qYfqdVwX0fil71onLpLkh","discogs":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/1296190","bandcamp":"https://theeohseespaulcary.bandcamp.com","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/4b2d205a-715a-4c6c-ba5b-c5fcbf9cdf25"},"img":null},"works":[{"id":263439237194389,"type":"album","name":"The Master's Bedroom Is Worth Spending a Night In","artist":"Thee Oh Sees","year":2008,"weight":5,"yt":"XhR99ywv5Ik","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":36355441347599,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Garage Punk","rank":94,"scaruffi":null},{"id":231664946546858,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Garage Psych","rank":72,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":123916963820023,"type":"album"